From: Loong <galletzeynep481@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] defenvs: nokia_xg-040g-md: TEST BUILD - disable all automatic flash access

*** DO NOT SHIP THIS PATCH. FOR BENCH VALIDATION ONLY. ***

Purpose: run this U-Boot from RAM (loaded over serial via BootROM) on a board
that is currently running a DIFFERENT bootloader, in order to test the httpd
command without touching flash at all.

The stock default environment is written for a factory-fresh board and will
happily reformat flash on first boot:

    bootmenu_delay=0      -> cmd/bootmenu.c: "If delay is 0 do not create
                             menu, just run first entry"
    bootmenu_0            -> run _firstboot
    _firstboot            -> _init_env -> ubi_create_env
    ubi_create_env        -> ubi create ubootenv ... || run ubi_format
    ubi_format            -> mtd erase ubi

On a board whose flash still holds another bootloader layout, "ubi part ubi"
targets 0x20000 (per this U-Boot's DTB), finds no valid UBI, and the fallback
erases everything from 0x20000 upwards -- destroying a bootloader that lives
at 0x0..0x80000.  With bootdelay=0 there is no chance to interrupt.

This patch makes every automatic path a no-op so the board stops at the
prompt.  Flash is then only touched by commands typed by hand.

--- a/defenvs/an7581_nokia_xg-040g-md_env
+++ b/defenvs/an7581_nokia_xg-040g-md_env
@@ -2,9 +2,9 @@
 serverip=192.168.1.254
 loadaddr=0x90000000
 console=earlycon=uart8250,mmio32,0x11002000 console=ttyS0
-bootcmd=run check_buttons ; run boot_ubi
+bootcmd=echo '*** TEST BUILD: automatic boot disabled, flash untouched ***'
 bootconf=config-1
-bootdelay=0
+bootdelay=3
 bootfile=openwrt-airoha-an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-ubi-initramfs-recovery.itb
 bootfile_bl2=openwrt-airoha-an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-ubi-preloader.bin
 bootfile_fip=openwrt-airoha-an7581-nokia_xg-040g-md-ubi-bl31-uboot.fip
@@ -12,9 +12,9 @@
 bootled_status=green:power
 bootmenu_confirm_return=askenv - Press ENTER to return to menu ; bootmenu 60
 bootmenu_default=0
-bootmenu_delay=0
+bootmenu_delay=-1
 bootmenu_title=      [0;34m( ( ( [1;39mOpenWrt[0;34m ) ) )
-bootmenu_0=Initialize environment.=run _firstboot
+bootmenu_0=DISABLED in test build (would erase flash)=echo refused
 bootmenu_0d=Run default boot command.=run boot_default
 bootmenu_1=Boot system via TFTP=run boot_tftp ; run bootmenu_confirm_return
 bootmenu_2=Boot production system from NAND=run boot_production ; run bootmenu_confirm_return
